      "answer": "The approved live patch window for Verdant Bay is on 2026-03-24 from 02:00 to 04:00 local time, as granted and customer approved for the emergency playbook fix addressing policy evaluation order and cache invalidation issues.\n\nIf validation checks fail during the live patch, the rollback procedure is to use the command 'orchestrator rollback --target ruleset=<prior_sha>' which rehydrates the prior ruleset and replays the cache invalidation hook. After rollback, Verdant Bay is notified, an incident is opened for manual remediation, and any partial replays are reverted. This rollback is automatic if any validation fails, which includes running 50 synthetic approval flows and sampling 50 in-flight approvals marked by the customer during the patch window.\n\nThese details come from the Orchestrator Emergency Playbook for Verdant Bay, which includes the patch steps, validation, and rollback procedure explicitly [art_fff67d92fe41].",
