      "answer": "The customer most likely to defect to a cheaper tactical competitor if we miss the next promised milestone is Pioneer Freight Solutions. The exact milestone is the acceptance of the remediation plan by 2026-05-14, with specific acceptance criteria including precision@10 >= 0.8 for facility lookups, entity-link hit rate >= 90%, and grouping false positives <= 5%. This milestone corresponds to the validation window of the remediation plan addressing the taxonomy change incident that degraded search relevance and increased manual triage efforts. Missing this milestone risks the customer extending their tactical PoC with NoiseGuard, a lower-cost competitor, and reducing scope with Northstar [art_7373b64fdfdd, art_79cf94421871, art_ac8afb52f2d3].",
